<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Colors, Backgrounds, Fonts, Text Styles</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      /* 2. Backgrounds - Set background color for the body */
      background-color: #f8f8f8; /* Light gray background */
      color: #333;
    }

    h1 {
      /* 3. Fonts - Apply different font families and sizes */
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
      font-size: 2.5em; /* Larger font size */
      /* 1. Colors - Change text color */
      color: #2c3e50; /* Dark blue text */
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .text-color-example {
      /* 1. Colors - Change text color */
      color: #e74c3c; /* Red text */
      font-size: 1.1em;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .background-color-example {
      /* 2. Backgrounds - Set background color */
      background-color: #2ecc71; /* Green background */
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .background-image-example {
      /* 2. Backgrounds - Set background image */
      background-image: url(IMAGES/india\ asia\ cup.jpeg); /* Placeholder image */
      background-size: cover; /* Cover the entire area */
      background-position: center; /* Center the image */
      background-repeat: no-repeat; /* Do not repeat the image */
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); /* Text shadow for readability */
    }

    .font-styles-example {
      /* 3. Fonts - Apply different font families and sizes */
      font-family: 'Verdana', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2em;
      /* 4. Text Styles - Use bold, italic */
      font-weight: bold; /* Bold text */
      font-style: italic; /* Italic text */
      color: #8e44ad; /* Purple text */
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .text-decoration-example {
      /* 4. Text Styles - Use underline */
      text-decoration: underline; /* Underlined text */
      color: #3498db; /* Blue text */
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .text-transform-example {
      /* 4. Text Styles - Use uppercase */
      text-transform: uppercase; /* All text in uppercase */
      letter-spacing: 1px; /* Add some letter spacing */
      color: #f39c12; /* Orange text */
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .border-color-example {
      border: 3px solid; /* 3px solid border */
      /* 1. Colors - Change border color */
      border-color: #1abc9c; /* Teal border */
      padding: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background-color: #ecf0f1; /* Light background for contrast */
    }

    .line-height-example {
      line-height: 1.8; /* Increased line height */
      font-size: 1.1em;
      color: #2980b9;
    }

    .text-shadow-example {
      /* 4. Text Styles - Use text-shadow */
      font-size: 2em;
      color: #34495e;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); /* Horizontal, Vertical, Blur, Color */
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>CSS Styling Demonstration</h1>

  <p class="text-color-example">
    This paragraph demonstrates changing **text color** to red.
  </p>

  <div class="background-color-example">
    This div has a **green background color**.
  </div>

  <div class="background-image-example">
    <h2>Background Image Example</h2>
    <p>This section uses a **background image** with `background-size: cover` and `background-position: center`.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="font-styles-example">
    This text uses a different **font family (Verdana)**, is **bold**, and **italic**.
  </p>

  <p class="text-decoration-example">
    This text is **underlined** using `text-decoration`.
  </p>

  <p class="text-transform-example">
    This text is converted to **uppercase** and has **letter spacing**.
  </p>

  <div class="border-color-example">
    This div has a **teal border color**.
    <p class="line-height-example">
      This paragraph inside the bordered div has an **increased line height** for better readability.
      It shows how `line-height` affects vertical spacing between lines of text.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="text-shadow-example">
    Text with Shadow!
  </p>

</body>
</html>
